# A battle ends the run (timed-run): the run state is poked to tick 40 of a dash in the Delrich Temple just
# before the first battle (the player flags word is 0 there); in the
# battle the run state (player +0x40 bits 5..12) sits at 180, the end of the cooldown, and back in the field
# it is 0 (ready) with the hand at the top and Jian walking. Run with --save.
include boot_from_save
include cheats_strong
include warp6
watch u32 0x020B000C mode
watch u32 0x020B6CF0 run_state
poke u32 0x020B6CF0 0x500
wait 270
shot rb_battle
press A 3
wait 17
